<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>CHILLY - Connect, Share, Enjoy</title>
<style>
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f1f5f9;color:#172554}
header{background:#172554;color:white;padding:22px;text-align:center}
header h1{margin:0;color:#67e8f9;font-size:36px}
main{max-width:650px;margin:20px auto;padding:12px}
.card{background:white;padding:20px;margin-bottom:16px;border-radius:12px}
button{background:#0891b2;color:white;border:0;border-radius:7px;padding:12px;margin:4px;cursor:pointer}
input,textarea{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:12px;margin:7px 0;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:7px}
nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
.muted{color:#64748b;font-size:14px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>CHILLY</h1>
<p>Connect. Share. Enjoy.</p>
</header>
<main>
<section class="card">
<h2>Welcome to CHILLY 👋</h2>
<p>Meet friends, share your moments and enjoy our community.</p>
</section>
<section class="card">
<h2>Create an account</h2>
<p class="muted">Email registration and login will be connected to Supabase next.</p>
<input type="email" placeholder="Your email address">
<input type="password" placeholder="Create a password">
<button type="button" onclick="alert('We will activate registration after connecting Supabase.')">Sign up</button>
<button type="button" onclick="alert('We will activate login after connecting Supabase.')">Log in</button>
<button type="button" onclick="alert('Password reset will be connected next.')">Forgot password?</button>
</section>
<nav>
<button onclick="show('feed')">Home</button>
<button onclick="show('rooms')">Rooms</button>
<button onclick="show('games')">Games</button>
<button onclick="show('messages')">Messages</button>
</nav>
<section class="card" id="feed">
<h2>Home Feed 🏠</h2>
<textarea placeholder="What would you like to share?"></textarea>
<button onclick="alert('Post saving will be connected to the database next.')">Create post</button>
<p class="muted">Share your thoughts and connect with friends.</p>
</section>
<section class="card" id="rooms" hidden>
<h2>Community Rooms 🎙️</h2>
<p>Public and private rooms, music and conversations.</p>
<p class="muted">Live rooms will be added in a later step.</p>
</section>
<section class="card" id="games" hidden>
<h2>Games 🎮</h2>
<p>Ludo · Draft · Pool · Racing · Football · Cards</p>
<p class="muted">Multiplayer games and paid matches will be built and tested separately.</p>
</section>
<section class="card" id="messages" hidden>
<h2>Messages 💬</h2>
<p>Private messaging will be added in a later step.</p>
</section>
</main>
<footer style="text-align:center;padding:20px">CHILLY © 2026</footer>
<script>
function show(id){
['feed','rooms','games','messages'].forEach(function(name){
document.getElementById(name).hidden = name !== id;
});
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
